WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.427
The Centre collects most taxes.

2
00:00:02.427 --> 00:00:03.715
The states do most of

3
00:00:03.715 --> 00:00:04.792
the spending.

4
00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:06.221
So who decides how the

5
00:00:06.221 --> 00:00:07.768
money is shared?

6
00:00:08.102 --> 00:00:09.555
Under Article 280,

7
00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:11.305
the President sets up a

8
00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:14.188
Finance Commission every five years.

9
00:00:14.188 --> 00:00:16.193
It recommends how central taxes

10
00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:18.472
are shared with the states.

11
00:00:19.157 --> 00:00:20.691
The Fifteenth Commission,

12
00:00:20.691 --> 00:00:21.618
chaired by N.

13
00:00:21.618 --> 00:00:23.412
K. Singh,

14
00:00:23.412 --> 00:00:25.339
gave the states 41 percent

15
00:00:25.339 --> 00:00:27.477
of the divisible pool.

16
00:00:27.806 --> 00:00:29.265
Poorer states get more,

17
00:00:29.265 --> 00:00:30.958
through income distance.

18
00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:32.316
Population, area,

19
00:00:32.316 --> 00:00:33.336
forest cover,

20
00:00:33.336 --> 00:00:36.467
and demographic performance also count.

21
00:00:36.799 --> 00:00:38.070
Your turn.

22
00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.333
Which Article sets it up?
